{
    "test_name": "MOB.360_Work_Add_Labor_Charge",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.360_Work_Add_Labor_Charge",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.360` Add a labor charge to the fixture work order.\n- Fields cascade: userId must be picked BEFORE craftId, whose loadOptions returns\n  an empty list without a user, and which is reset whenever userId changes.\n- Searches for Dev Eloper explicitly: crafts belong to the SELECTED user, and an\n  arbitrary first-match user usually has none. This one has many, so taking the\n  first craft is safe and avoids depending on a specific craft continuing to exist.\n- The craft field is focused but NOT typed into: its filter lowercases the query but\n  not the option name, so any typed text with capitals matches nothing.\n- Visits /work first to warm the cache-only lookups (see module docstring).\n- MUTATES: adds a permanent labor charge to EYRpYJ9QYdQ1JFF10JtB0Q on every run.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Work Order",
            "ELMO",
            "CRUD"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
        "config": {
            "assertions": [],
            "config_variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "headers": {},
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{ MOBDEV }}"
            },
            "variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
